1
00:00:00,500 --> 00:00:03,574
In this lesson, we'll set
up your business profile.

2
00:00:03,574 --> 00:00:07,914
It only takes a few minutes, but it
affects almost everything in Kyntlo,

3
00:00:07,914 --> 00:00:12,375
from your invoices and emails to
appointment times and phone registration.

4
00:00:13,253 --> 00:00:16,091
Click Settings at the
bottom of the sidebar.

5
00:00:16,091 --> 00:00:20,930
Business Profile is the first page in
the settings menu, under My Business.

6
00:00:20,930 --> 00:00:24,091
If you can't see Settings,
ask the account owner,

7
00:00:24,091 --> 00:00:26,993
because only admins can
change these details.

8
00:00:27,845 --> 00:00:29,525
Start with your logo.

9
00:00:29,525 --> 00:00:32,965
Click the upload area
and choose your file.

10
00:00:32,965 --> 00:00:36,804
A wide logo works best,
around 350 × 180 pixels.

11
00:00:36,804 --> 00:00:42,804
It appears on your invoices, booking
pages and other customer-facing pages.

12
00:00:43,654 --> 00:00:45,589
Next, your business details.

13
00:00:45,589 --> 00:00:48,353
The friendly name is what customers see.

14
00:00:48,353 --> 00:00:54,088
The legal name must match your official
registration exactly, including Ltd or LLC.

15
00:00:54,088 --> 00:00:59,271
Add it now, because phone and texting
registrations are checked against it.

16
00:01:00,122 --> 00:01:02,969
Check your business
email, phone and website.

17
00:01:02,969 --> 00:01:06,449
These are used as defaults
in emails and on your pages.

18
00:01:06,449 --> 00:01:11,447
Choose your business niche, then click
Update Information to save this section.

19
00:01:12,297 --> 00:01:14,471
Below that is your business address.

20
00:01:14,471 --> 00:01:19,243
It's shown on invoices and used for your
Google listing and phone registration,

21
00:01:19,243 --> 00:01:21,236
so use your real trading address.

22
00:01:22,086 --> 00:01:25,595
Now the time zone, which is
more important than it looks.

23
00:01:25,595 --> 00:01:29,905
It controls when appointments show,
when reminders and workflows send,

24
00:01:29,905 --> 00:01:32,122
and how your reports count each day.

25
00:01:32,122 --> 00:01:36,739
Pick the time zone where your business
operates, then click Update Address.

26
00:01:36,739 --> 00:01:41,665
If your team travels, that's fine: the
business time zone is what customers book

27
00:01:41,665 --> 00:01:42,158
against.

28
00:01:43,008 --> 00:01:47,684
Business Information holds your legal
details: business type, industry,

29
00:01:47,684 --> 00:01:49,594
and your registration number.

30
00:01:49,594 --> 00:01:52,623
In the UK, that's your
Companies House number.

31
00:01:52,623 --> 00:01:54,270
In the US, it's your EIN.

32
00:01:54,270 --> 00:01:59,539
Phone carriers use these details to approve
your number for calling and texting.

33
00:02:00,389 --> 00:02:03,604
On the right, add your
authorized representative.

34
00:02:03,604 --> 00:02:07,803
This is the person carriers may
contact about your registration,

35
00:02:07,803 --> 00:02:09,902
usually the owner or a director.

36
00:02:10,752 --> 00:02:12,730
Finally, the General settings.

37
00:02:12,730 --> 00:02:15,564
Leave Allow Duplicate
Contact switched off,

38
00:02:15,564 --> 00:02:19,124
so a lead who fills in two
forms stays as one contact.

39
00:02:19,124 --> 00:02:21,959
And keep Mark email as
invalid switched on,

40
00:02:21,959 --> 00:02:24,925
so you stop sending to
addresses that bounce.

41
00:02:25,775 --> 00:02:27,255
One more page to know.

42
00:02:27,255 --> 00:02:32,300
My Profile, just below, holds your own
details: your name, photo, password,

43
00:02:32,300 --> 00:02:34,924
email signature and two-factor sign-in.

44
00:02:34,924 --> 00:02:37,346
Each team member fills in their own.

45
00:02:38,196 --> 00:02:39,311
Here's a pro tip.

46
00:02:39,311 --> 00:02:44,360
Copy your legal name, registration number
and address word for word from your

47
00:02:44,360 --> 00:02:45,606
official documents.

48
00:02:45,606 --> 00:02:50,918
Even a small mismatch is the most common
reason phone registrations get rejected,

49
00:02:50,918 --> 00:02:53,803
and every resubmission
adds days of waiting.

50
00:02:54,651 --> 00:02:56,544
Your business profile is done!

51
00:02:56,544 --> 00:03:01,655
Next, we'll invite your team, and decide
exactly what each person can see and do.

52
00:03:01,655 --> 00:03:02,539
See you there.
